"text": "X-twitter",
"href": "https://x.com/Russo4Ohio"
},
{
"text": "[image: As we wrap up the first week of record-breaking Early Vote turnout across Ohio, I’m grateful to our bipartisan local election officials who work tirelessly to ensure every eligible Ohioan’s vote is counted in safe, secure, and accessible elections. This week, I visited the Summit County Board of Elections to hear about their work this elections cycle and emerging needs for future elections. As Secretary of State, I’ll always stand with our local election officials and ensure they have the support needed to make every Ohioan’s voice heard.]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeShK5Dj4Gq/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Back on THE #OhioState campus today with @amyactonoh! I love the energy of these Buckeyes and young voters who are ready to use their voice to vote for their future and leaders who care about Ohio’s future. There are only 20 days left to make sure your vote counts➡️ www.iwillvote.com. O-H!♥️🩶]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DefPctkj0tR/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Earlier this weekend, I was honored to be with Congresswoman @shontelbrown for her 2026 Legacy Celebration with friends and community leaders across Cleveland.]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeWvgcxIC0b/"
},
{
"text": "[image: It was a great night and packed event at the @allen_co_oh_dems Annual Dinner in Lima! We are only 3 weeks away from Election Day, and early voting is in full swing. That’s 21 days to get off the sidelines and do everything you can to support great candidates, get out the vote, and show the rest of the country what happens when we all come together and demand better for Ohio!]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DebxTgPoBsO/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Thank you for all the kind birthday wishes on my big milestone birthday yesterday! The best gift you can give me and yourself is to go out and VOTE!🎉🗳️]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/Dej164TPnrz/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Two more votes banked, and it feels so good!🎉 Early voting is happening now, Ohio! Don’t sit this one out! Find your early vote location➡️ voteohio.gov]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DehMUwDPkAl/"
},
